<span class="line"><span>[   26.090399] testvm1.both.org audit[1]: SERVICE_START pid=1 uid=0 auid=4294967295 ses=4294967295 msg=&#39;unit=NetworkManager-wait-online comm=&quot;systemd&quot; exe=&quot;/usr/lib/systemd/systemd&quot; hostname=? addr=? termina&gt;&quot;&#39;</span></span>
